        "text": "ut not deep enough\nI call not\neven boredom\nSomewhere\nshallower but not close enough\nI can't place\nit in words\nIt comes when\neverything is so still\nIt comes when\nthe music of the past played\nSuddenly\nbringing flashes of longing\nBut nowhere\nnor no one to long to\nIt's\nstrange...\nIf only these\nwalls can talk\nThey'd know\nwhat I'm telling you\nBut in words\nit can never paint the picture\nProbably,\nsometime soon\nIt will come\nto me\nAfterall,\nit's a journey to discover\n~\nmacdeuz\n(lifted from my OneNote)\na ",
